WEBVTT

00:06:58.756 --> 00:07:01.716
And all of these things
affect climate change, too,

00:07:01.756 --> 00:07:06.956
in fact, all 17 of the United Nations
Sustainable Development Goals

00:07:06.956 --> 00:07:10.076
are interrelated and inseparable.

00:07:10.796 --> 00:07:12.956
So we need to start realizing

00:07:12.956 --> 00:07:16.156
that we can't solve
any of these things in isolation.

00:07:16.996 --> 00:07:21.076
We need to align our decarbonization goals

00:07:21.116 --> 00:07:22.876
with our social goals

00:07:22.876 --> 00:07:25.236
to be able to achieve any of them at all.

00:07:25.676 --> 00:07:30.556
(Applause)